# Fixture granted a rolled FIREWAND wand and wielded it (equip VERB path is
# proven by town-new; slot disambiguation by name does not exist in verbs).
# Open the panel to observe, portal to Main 1, kill by missile. No injected
# entities, damage or kills.
menu main
button continue
level Town 0
frames 2
key I
inventory open
frames 1
capture wand_equipped
key I
inventory closed
trigger-nearest
level Main 1
frames 3
capture populated
kill-nearest
frames 5
capture missile_kill
key ESC
menu pause
button save-exit
